msgstr "记录维护者必须稳定保留的扩展点、不变量和限制。"

#: manual/design/elab.md:11
msgid "Maintenance Notes"
msgstr "维护说明"

#: manual/design/elab.md:13
msgid "Update this page whenever the module boundary, core algorithm, or observable semantics change."
msgstr "只要模块边界、核心算法或可观察语义变化，就更新本页。"

#: manual/design/elab.md:14
msgid "If the module is intentionally incomplete, say so here instead of documenting speculative APIs."
msgstr "如果模块仍然不完整，也要明确写出，不要伪造未来 API。"

#: manual/index.md:1
msgid "stella"
msgstr "stella"

#: manual/index.md:3
msgid "stella is a proof assistant written in MoonBit and still a work in progress. Its core is the `elab` package, a bidirectional type checker for Martin-Löf type theory based on normalization by evaluation."
msgstr "stella 是一个用 MoonBit 编写、仍在开发中的证明助手。其核心是 `elab` 包——一个基于求值归一化（normalization by evaluation）的 Martin-Löf 类型论双向类型检查器。"

#: manual/index.md:5
msgid "The checker supports the unit type, Π types, Σ types, identity types with the J eliminator, W types and a universe hierarchy, with contravariant subtyping for Π types."
msgstr "该检查器支持单位类型、Π 类型、Σ 类型、带 J 消去子的恒等类型、W 类型和宇宙层级，并支持 Π 类型的逆变子类型。"

#: manual/index.md:7
msgid "Packages"
msgstr "包"

#: manual/index.md:9
msgid "**`elab`** (`src/elab`): abstract syntax, evaluation, quotation and bidirectional type checking. See the [API reference](api/elab.md), the [design notes](design/elab.md) and the [tutorial](tutorial/elab.md)."
msgstr "**`elab`**（`src/elab`）：抽象语法、求值、引用（quotation）与双向类型检查。参见 [API 参考](api/elab.md)、[设计说明](design/elab.md)和[教程](tutorial/elab.md)。"

#: manual/index.md:11
msgid "Theory"
msgstr "理论"

#: manual/index.md:13
msgid "The treatise below develops the type theory behind stella, from the untyped lambda calculus to Martin-Löf type theory, and explains how the kernel elaborates it. Read it as the narrative overview before working on elaboration details or extending the proof language."
msgstr "下面的论述从无类型 lambda 演算一路发展到 Martin-Löf 类型论，阐述 stella 背后的类型理论，并说明内核如何对其进行 elaboration。在深入 elaboration 细节或扩展证明语言之前，请先把它当作整体概述来阅读。"

#: manual/index.md:15
msgid "[Foundations and Elaboration of Stella Based on Dependent Type Theory](../attachments/stella_foundations.typ)"
msgstr "[基于依值类型论的 Stella 基础与 Elaboration](../attachments/stella_foundations.typ)"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:1
msgid "elab Tutorial"
msgstr "elab 教程"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:3
msgid "Use this page as the starting point for practical workflows around this module. elab in Luna-Flow/stella."
msgstr "本页用于说明这个模块的实际使用路径。 这里聚焦 Luna-Flow/stella 中的 elab。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:5
msgid "Suggested Flow"
msgstr "建议阅读顺序"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:7
msgid "Read the repository README and the elab API reference."
msgstr "先看仓库 README 和 elab 的 API 文档。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:8
msgid "Start from the constructors or entry points under `src/elab`."
msgstr "从 `src/elab` 中的构造入口或主入口开始。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:9
msgid "Validate behavior with the existing tests or examples before depending on edge-case semantics."
msgstr "在依赖边界行为之前，先结合已有测试或示例验证语义。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:11
msgid "Practical Guidance"
msgstr "实践建议"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:13
msgid "Prefer the documented entry points over internal helpers."
msgstr "优先使用已文档化的入口，而不是内部辅助函数。"

#: manual/tutorial/elab.md:14
msgid "Record runtime, numeric, or proof-state assumptions explicitly in downstream code."
msgstr "下游代码里显式记录运行时、数值或证明状态前提。"

